          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kio chija, malaika wa BWANA ukaida na kubwagha Waashuru elfu ighana na mirongo wunyanya na isanu werekoghe kambinyi. Hata iji wandu wawuka nakesho kio, wikawona wandu wose wafue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
